=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One lingering question I did have, however, is \u201cwhat\u2019s a Lit RPG?\u201d</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/LitRPG\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2d/Dados_4_a_20_caras_trans.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/LitRPG\" target=\"_blank\"> LitRPG - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/LitRPG\" target=\"_blank\"> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/LitRPG </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8890-nullapostle","name":"NullApostle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-15T21:08:17-07:00","id":1396799,"title":"","content":"Just listened to the podcast, interesting, very interesting. <br /> <br /> The Anima stuff sounded really interesting. Sooo many interesting nuances in the podcast. Very very awesome stuff. <br /> <br /> Hopepunk, very verrrrry interesting. <br /> <br /> Sooo instead of some sort of Inspired as the player character the idea is to play a mundane with MMO VR cyber tech features. Hmm, interesting. (Now obviously, nothing stops from playing Novas, Psiads, or Talents - as said in the podcast.) <br /> <br /> On groups I hope the Global Geographic Society is present, maybe with them having certain secret knowledge about beyond the world. hehe<br /> <br /> The Aberrant stuff had a bunch of 'yay' and a bunch of 'sighs' but in general it was fascinating.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}